    &= \frac{1}{\sqrt{2}} \sqrt{\left|\left(1 + \cos\left(\frac{7\pi}{15}\right)\right) - 1\right|^2}\\
    &= \frac{1}{\sqrt{2}} \left|\left(1 + \cos\left(\frac{7\pi}{15}\right)\right) - 1\right| =\frac{1}{\sqrt{2}} \left|\cos\left(\frac{7\pi}{15}\right) \right|
\end{align*}
\]

