output_sample_10:
$\tan 100^\circ + 4 \sin 100^\circ$ を $\tan \frac{\pi}{10}$ + 4 $\tanh \frac{\pi}{4} $ と変形し、和積の公式を使うと、
\begin{align*}
\tan \frac{\pi}{10} + 4 \tanh \frac{\pi}{4}  &= \frac{2 \tan \frac{\pi}{20}}{1 - 2 \tan^2 \frac{\pi}{20}} + 4 \cdot \frac{2 \tanh \frac{\pi}{20}}{1 + \tanh^2 \frac{\pi}{20}} \\
&= \frac{4 \tan \frac{\pi}{20}}{1 - 2 \tan^2 \frac{\pi}{20}} + \frac{8 \tanh \frac{\pi}{20}}{1 + \tanh^2 \frac{\pi}{20}} \\
&= \frac{4 \tan \frac{\pi}{20} + 8 \tanh \frac{\pi}{20}}{2} + \frac{4 \tan^2 \frac{\pi}{20} - 8 \tanh \frac{\pi}{20}}{2}.
\end{align*}
さらに、二重角の公式を使って、
\begin{align*}
\tan 2 x &= \frac{2 \tan x}{1 - 2 \tan^2 x} \\
\tanh 2 x &= \frac{2 \tanh x}{1 + \tanh^2 x},
\end{align*}
したがって、
\begin{align*}
\frac{4 \tan \frac{\pi}{20} + 8 \tanh \frac{\pi}{20}}{2} + \frac{4 \tan^2 \frac{\pi}{20} - 8 \tanh \frac{\pi}{20}}{2} &= \frac{1}{2} \tan \frac{2 \pi}{20} + \frac{1}{2} \tanh \frac{2 \pi}{20} \\
&= \boxed{\frac{\tan \frac{\pi}{10}}{2} + \frac{\tanh \frac{\pi}{10}}{2}}.
\end{align*}

